sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Controller
    participant M as Model
    participant R as Radio loop
    R->>C: retry rate spike, PDR about normal
    C->>M: observation
    M-->>C: prior favours congestion or reactive, run spectrum_scan
    C->>R: spectrum_scan
    R-->>C: energy on active channel, none elsewhere
    C->>M: updated observation
    M-->>C: run silent_listen
    C->>R: silent_listen for 1s
    R-->>C: noise and retries fall to nominal while silent
    C->>M: updated observation
    M-->>C: reactive at 0.86, so change_tdma_slot then set_tx_power down
    C->>R: apply actions
    R-->>C: retry rate normalises, PDR recovers
    Note over C,R: no channel hop, no false jamming declaration
